One Solution Design (Example)

Project: Face-Based Attendance System
Steps:
1.⁠ ⁠Capture face using webcam
2.⁠ ⁠Detect face using OpenCV Haar Cascade
3.⁠ ⁠Compare with stored images
4.⁠ ⁠Mark attendance automatically
5.⁠ ⁠Store in database (CSV/SQL)

Simple Face Detection Code

import cv2

face_cascade = cv2.CascadeClassifier(
    cv2.data.haarcascades + 'haarcascade_frontalface_default.xml'
)

img = cv2.imread("face.jpg")
gray = cv2.cvtColor(img, cv2.COLOR_BGR2GRAY)

faces = face_cascade.detectMultiScale(gray, 1.3, 5)

for (x, y, w, h) in faces:
    cv2.rectangle(img, (x,y), (x+w, y+h), (255,0,0), 2)

cv2.imshow("Faces", img)
cv2.waitKey(0)
cv2.destroyAllWindows()
